    <briefdescription>
<para>Pair-wise part for the Embedded <ref refid="structAtom" kindref="compound">Atom</ref> Method descriptor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><formula id="15">\[ V_i = \frac{1}{2} \sum_{j \neq i} \psi(r_{ij}) \]</formula></para>
<para>This descriptor will load tabulated values for the two-body potential <formula id="16">$ \phi $</formula> from the provided <ref refid="classConfig_1SETFL" kindref="member">SETFL</ref> file.</para>
<para>This descriptor is usually used together with the many-body descriptor <ref refid="classDM__EAM" kindref="compound">DM_EAM</ref> although this is not required and user can mix it with any other descriptors or use it on its own.</para>
<para>This descriptor will enforce cutoff distance as specified in a <ref refid="classConfig_1SETFL" kindref="member">SETFL</ref> file. Set <ref refid="classConfig_1RCUT2B" kindref="member">RCUT2B</ref> to the same value to suppress the warning message.</para>
<para>Required <ref refid="classConfig" kindref="compound">Config</ref> keys: <ref refid="classConfig_1INIT2B" kindref="member">INIT2B</ref> <ref refid="classConfig_1SETFL" kindref="member">SETFL</ref> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
